{
  "_comment": [
    "Deepgram Aura-2 narrator roster. Copy to voices_deepgram.json on DATA_DIR and edit there; the live copy wins.",
    "'voice_id' is the bare Deepgram voice name; the module builds 'aura-2-<id>-en' from it.",
    "'reporter' is the on-air name the narrator says in the sign-off. Deepgram's mythological names cannot be",
    "used directly: 'I'm Orpheus, for The Gist' is not a reporter. Keep the persona's implied gender and accent",
    "consistent with the voice, or the sign-off fights what the listener just heard.",
    "'speed' is an optional rate multiplier. Apollo was rejected at the default pace and kept at 1.3, which is",
    "the useful lesson: a voice turned down for pace is a setting, not a dead end.",
    "'keywords' feed the smart caster exactly as they do for the ElevenLabs roster.",
    "This roster was chosen by ear on 2026-08-23 from a 12-voice audition; every voice Deepgram tags for",
    "storytelling, breathy, melodic, IVR or advertising was excluded before the audition, because those tags",
    "predicted the rejections in the first round."
  ],

  "default_voice": "thalia",
  "default_reporter": "Thalia Reyes",

  "match": [
